----- Native stack trace -----

 1: 0xb8d0a3 node::OOMErrorHandler(char const*, v8::OOMDetails const&) [node]
 2: 0xf06250 v8::Utils::ReportOOMFailure(v8::internal::Isolate*, char const*, v8::OOMDetails const&) [node]
