<summary><strong>run_poc.sh</strong></summary>

```bash
#!/bin/bash
# Fedify ReDoS Vulnerability PoC Runner

set -e

IMAGE_NAME="fedify-redos-poc"

echo "Building Docker image..."
docker build -t ${IMAGE_NAME} .

